      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "It is an way (approach) of writing softwares or developing applications.\n\nThe most important component of OOPs is \" Object \" .\n\nObject\n======\nAny real world entity is called object.\nexample --> Human, Car , Chair , Mobile, laptop, etc....\n---------",
      "autoResize": true,
